    <description>White glazed decorative vase, 0.216 m across and 0.296 m tall, authored from primitives: ellipsoid body, cylindrical foot, neck and flared rim with a contrasting band. Stands in for the racoon figurine on the living_room bookshelf - same role, an object the vacuum can see but not reach - sized to the racoon at the 1.5x scale living_room.world intends, and clearing the shelf above (0.360 m). 9 KB instead of 8.4 MB.</description>
